From 9a9e6f3ab9a7f58f84e9f350c9c3dcd1fe9c9456 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:43:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): continue and abort off the main thread; follow the
 next stop

Merge gains Running, MovedOn, Aborted(kind) and Finished(kind); a
write after a moved-on stop answers StopMovedOn. list_stop,
continue_operation and abort_operation sit beside the old commands
until the window moves over.

Refs plan #88 #89
